  "html": "<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"thumb tleft\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:152px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Vergrim2.jpg\" title=\"Vergrim, the Boss of Vergrim's Vexation\"><img alt=\"Vergrim, the Boss of Vergrim's Vexation\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"245\" src=\"/images/Vergrim2.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Vergrim2.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>Vergrim, the Boss of Vergrim's Vexation</b></div></div></div>\n</td><td><b>Vergrim's Vexation is recommended for levels 15 to 30.  It is the fourth dungeon in the usual sequence, proceeding from <a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a>.  It is accessible through <a href=\"/wiki/Vexation_Station\" title=\"Vexation Station\">Vexation Station</a>.</b>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Dungeon_Outline\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Dungeon Outline</span></h1>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"490\">\n<tr>\n<th><i>Dungeon Levels</i>\n</th><th><i>Layout</i>\n</th><th><i>Mobs</i>\n</th><th><i>Mobs</i>\n</th><th><i>Attacks to Use</i>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Vergrim's Vexation L 1-2</b>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ransacked_Library_Layout\" title=\"Ransacked Library Layout\">Ransacked Library</a>\n</td><td>Shadow Mutants\n</td><td>Shadow Fades, Divine Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Fire, Divine, Poison</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--Cavernous Cavern of Caves</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland</a>\n</td><td>Fire Whiskers, Divine Whiskers\n</td><td>Poison Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Fire, Divine, Poison</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Vergrim's Vexation L 3-4</b>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Dungeon_Layout\" title=\"Dungeon Layout\">Dungeon</a>\n</td><td>Shadow Mutants\n</td><td>Shadow Fades, Divine Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Fire, Divine, Poison</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--Crematorium</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Torture_Chamber_Layout\" title=\"Torture Chamber Layout\">Torture Chamber</a>\n</td><td>Fire Orok Sprites\n</td><td>Fire Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Divine</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Vergrim's Vexation L 5</b>\n</td><td> ---\n</td><td>Fire Whiskers\n</td><td>Divine Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Divine, Poison</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--Vergrim's Vibration Plant</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland</a>\n</td><td>Fire Whiskers\n</td><td>Poison Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Divine, Fire</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--Vergrim's Supply Depot</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Fields_Layout\" title=\"Ice Fields Layout\">Ice Fields</a>\n</td><td>Ice Mutants, Ice Fades\n</td><td>Ice Whiskers, Ice Orok Sprites\n</td><td><b>Divine, Poison,Shadow</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Vergrim's Vexation L 6</b>\n</td><td>  ---\n</td><td>Shadow Fades\n</td><td>Fire Whisker, Divine Whisker\n</td><td><b>Divine, Poison</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Vergrim's Vexation L 7</b>\n</td><td>  ---\n</td><td>Shadow Fades\n</td><td>Fire Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Divine</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><i> -- Clan of the Cave Yetti</i></b>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland</a>\n</td><td>Ice Oroks\n</td><td>Shadow Mutants\n</td><td><b>Shadow, Fire</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><i> -- The Tomb of Singe</i></b>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Torture_Chamber_Layout\" title=\"Torture Chamber Layout\">Torture Chamber</a>\n</td><td>Shadow Fades\n</td><td>Fire Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Divine</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b> ** Lair of the Vergrim</b>\n</td><td>  ---\n</td><td>Divine Demonspawn\n</td><td>Fire Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Shadow, Divine</b>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:297px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Vergrims3.jpg\" title=\"Vegrim's Vexation map\"><img alt=\"Vegrim's Vexation map\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"936\" src=\"/images/Vergrims3.jpg\" width=\"295\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Vergrims3.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Vegrim's Vexation map</div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"DUNGEON_DETAILS\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>DUNGEON DETAILS</b></span></h1>\n<a name=\"Level_1\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 1</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ransacked_Library_Layout\" title=\"Ransacked Library Layout\">Ransacked Library Layout</a>. Contains: <a href=\"/wiki/Ebon_Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Ebon Fade Lichlord\">Ebon Fade Lichlords</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Brood\" title=\"Flame Brood\">Flame Brood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Whisker\" title=\"Divine Whisker\">Divine Whiskers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Pincher\" title=\"Shadow Pincher\">Shadow Pinchers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_Banshee\" title=\"Shadow Fade Banshee\">Shadow Fade Banshees</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Hulk\" title=\"Shadow Hulk\">Shadow Hulks</a>.\n</p><p>An NPC called <a href=\"/wiki/Tangled_-_Sir_Kutree\" title=\"Tangled - Sir Kutree\">Tangled - Sir Kutree</a> is also located here.  He offers no quests and seems to have no function.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Cavernous_Cavern_of_Caves\" title=\"Cavernous Cavern of Caves\">Cavernous Cavern of Caves</a> is located off Level 1.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Cavernous_Cavern_of_Caves\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Cavernous Cavern of Caves</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland Layout</a>. Contains: <a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Spitter\" title=\"Crimson Spitter\">Crimson Spitters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Brood\" title=\"Flame Brood\">Flame Brood</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Brood\" title=\"Vergrim's Brood\">Vergrim's Brood</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Dancer\" title=\"Fire Dancer\">Fire Dancers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Whisker\" title=\"Divine Whisker\">Divine Whiskers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Blademaster\" title=\"Toxic Blademaster\">Toxic Blademasters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Venomspitter\" title=\"Toxic Venomspitter\">Toxic Venomspitters</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Whisker_Shaman\" title=\"Toxic Whisker Shaman\">Toxic Whisker Shamans</a>. \n</p><p>An NPC called <a href=\"/wiki/Skeer'ikt_the_Chirper\" title=\"Skeer'ikt the Chirper\">Skeer'ikt the Chirper</a> is located here and gives out a series of quests.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_2\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 2</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ransacked_Library_Layout\" title=\"Ransacked Library Layout\">Ransacked Library Layout</a>. Contains: <a href=\"/wiki/Ebon_Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Ebon Fade Lichlord\">Ebon Fade Lichlords</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Brood\" title=\"Flame Brood\">Flame Brood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Whisker\" title=\"Divine Whisker\">Divine Whiskers</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_Banshee\" title=\"Shadow Fade Banshee\">Shadow Fade Banshees</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Pincher\" title=\"Shadow Pincher\">Shadow Pinchers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Puker\" title=\"Shadow Puker\">Shadow Pukers</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Hulk\" title=\"Shadow Hulk\">Shadow Hulks</a>. \n</p><p>Some of <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Rattle_Tooth's_Relatives\" title=\"Category:Rattle Tooth's Relatives\">Rattle Tooth's Relatives</a> can be found here and are quest objects.  \n</p><p>An NPC called <a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Temdewm\" title=\"Sir Temdewm\">Sir Temdewm</a> is also located here.  He offers no quests and seems to have no purpose.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_3\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 3</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dungeon_Layout\" title=\"Dungeon Layout\">Dungeon Layout</a>. Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Ebon_Fade_Soldier\" title=\"Ebon Fade Soldier\">Ebon Fade Soldiers</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Ebon_Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Ebon Fade Lichlord\">Ebon Fade Lichlords</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ebon_Hatchling\" title=\"Ebon Hatchling\">Ebon Hatchlings</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_Banshee\" title=\"Shadow Fade Banshee\">Shadow Fade Banshees</a>. \n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Crematorium\" title=\"Crematorium\">Crematorium</a> is located off Level 3.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Crematorium\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Crematorium</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Torture_Chamber_Layout\" title=\"Torture Chamber Layout\">Torture Chamber Layout</a>. Contains: <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker\" title=\"Whisker\">Crimson Broodlings</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Sprite\" title=\"Flame Sprite\">Flame Sprites</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Spitter\" title=\"Crimson Spitter\">Crimson Spitters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fade_Skeleton\" title=\"Fade Skeleton\">Ebon Fade Soldiers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Hatchling\" title=\"Hatchling\">Ebon Fade Hatchlings</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker\" title=\"Whisker\">Vergrim's Broodlings</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/The_Cremator\" title=\"The Cremator\">The Cremator</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_4\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 4</span></h1>\n<p>Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Ebon_Hatchling\" title=\"Ebon Hatchling\">Ebon Hatchlings</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Ebon_Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Ebon Fade Lichlord\"> Ebon Fade Lichlords</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ebon_Fade_Soldier\" title=\"Ebon Fade Soldier\">Ebon Fade Soldiers</a>.\n</p><p>Some of <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Rattle_Tooth's_Relatives\" title=\"Category:Rattle Tooth's Relatives\">Rattle Tooth's Relatives</a> are quest objects on this level.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_5\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 5</span></h1>\n<p>Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Spitter\" title=\"Crimson Spitter\">Crimson Spitters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Shaman\" title=\"Whisker Shaman\">Crimson Shamans</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker\" title=\"Whisker\">Divine Broodlings</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Supply_Depot\" title=\"Vergrim's Supply Depot\">Vergrim's Supply Depot</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vibation_Plant\" title=\"Vergrim's Vibation Plant\">Vergrim's Vibation Plant</a> is located off Level 5, as well as a portal to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest_Base_Camp\" title=\"The Widower's Nest Base Camp\">The Widower's Nest Base Camp</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Vergrim.27s_Vibation_Plant\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Vergrim's Vibation Plant</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland Layout</a>. Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Blademaster\" title=\"Whisker Blademaster\">Fire Dancers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Shaman\" title=\"Whisker Shaman\">Crimson Shamans</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Venomspitter\" title=\"Whisker Venomspitter\">Toxic Venomspitters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Shaman\" title=\"Whisker Shaman\">Toxic Shamans</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Vergrim.27s_Supply_Depot\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Vergrim's Supply Depot</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Fields_Layout\" title=\"Ice Fields Layout\">Ice Fields Layout</a>. Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Snow_Sprite\" title=\"Snow Sprite\">Snow Sprites</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Frostbitten Hulks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Venomspitter\" title=\"Whisker Venomspitter\">Frostbitten Spitters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Fade Lichlord\">Arctic Fade Lichlords</a>, and some strange things called <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Barrel_o'_Fizz\" title=\"Barrel o' Fizz\">Barrel o' Fizz</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_6\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 6</span></h1>\n<p>Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Ebon_Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Ebon Fade Lichlord\">Ebon Fade Lichlord</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Dancer\" title=\"Fire Dancer\">Fire Dancers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Spitter\" title=\"Crimson Spitter\">Crimson Spitters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Whisker\" title=\"Divine Whisker\">Divine Whiskers</a>.  Here you will find Rattle Tooth's Librarian and Rattle Toe's Cook, who drop lots of good loot.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_7\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 7</span></h1>\n<p>Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Brood\" title=\"Flame Brood\">Flame Brood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Dancer\" title=\"Fire Dancer\">Fire Dancers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Spitter\" title=\"Crimson Spitter\">Crimson Spitters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Shaman\" title=\"Whisker Shaman\">Crimson Shamans</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Whisker\" title=\"Divine Whisker\">Divine Whiskers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Fade Lichlord\">Ebon Lich Lords</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Twins\" title=\"Shadow Twins\">Shadow Twins</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Clan_of_the_Cave_Yetti\" title=\"Clan of the Cave Yetti\">Clan of the Cave Yetti</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Tomb_of_Singe\" title=\"The Tomb of Singe\">The Tomb of Singe</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Lair_of_Vergrim\" title=\"Lair of Vergrim\">Lair of Vergrim</a> are located off Level 7\n</p>\n<a name=\"Clan_of_the_Cave_Yetti\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Clan of the Cave Yetti</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland Layout</a>. Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Juggernaut\" title=\"Orok Juggernaut\">Orok Juggernauts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Cave_Shaman\" title=\"Cave Shaman\">Cave Shamans</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Puker\" title=\"Shadow Puker\">Shadow Pukers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Unipsycho\" title=\"Mutant Unipsycho\">Shadow Unipsychos</a>, and of course the <a href=\"/wiki/Cave_Yetti\" title=\"Cave Yetti\">Cave Yettis</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"The_Tomb_of_Singe\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">The Tomb of Singe</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Torture_Chamber_Layout\" title=\"Torture Chamber Layout\">Torture Chamber Layout</a>. Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Ebon_Fade_Soldier\" title=\"Ebon Fade Soldier\">Ebon Fade Soldiers</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Fade_General\" title=\"Fade General\">Ebon Fade Generals</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ebon_Hatchling\" title=\"Ebon Hatchling\">Ebon Hatchlings</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fade_Banshee\" title=\"Fade Banshee\">Fade Banshees</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Seer\" title=\"Whisker Seer\">Crimson Shamans</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Spitter\" title=\"Crimson Spitter\">Crimson Spitters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Brood\" title=\"Flame Brood\">Flame Brood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Sprite\" title=\"Flame Sprite\">Flame Sprites</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Singe_Prophet\" title=\"Singe Prophet\">Singe Prophet</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Lair_of_the_Vergrim\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Lair of the Vergrim</span></h1>\n<p>An empty corridor and then the room where <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim\" title=\"Vergrim\">Vergrim</a> will be found.  He is protected by <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Broodling\" title=\"Whisker Broodling\">Whisker Broodlings</a> and two Whisker Blademaster Champions, <a href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Tooth's_DJ\" title=\"Rattle Tooth's DJ\">Rattle Tooth's DJ</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Toe's_Personal_Masseur\" title=\"Rattle Toe's Personal Masseur\">Rattle Toe's Personal Masseur</a>.  When Vergrim is defeated the Boss Door opens to a treasure room and a one way portal to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest_Base_Camp\" title=\"The Widower's Nest Base Camp\">The Widower's Nest Base Camp</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
